# Real patient data transcribed from the "Labstacks orders" sheet: names,
# mobile numbers and dates of birth for 210 people. This repository is
# public, so the rows themselves stay local — `npm run dummy:generate`
# rebuilds 02-seed.sql from data/*.csv, and docker/labstack-dummy/README.md
# documents the expected CSV shape.
docker/labstack-dummy/data/
docker/labstack-dummy/02-seed.sql
